        <li>Renewable annually—you're not locked into a multi-year commitment.</li>
        <li>No residency quota—Spain accepts NLV applications from all nations, including the US.</li>
        <li>Gateway to permanent residence—after 5 years on NLV, you can apply for indefinite residence.</li>
        <li>Growing community—thousands of Americans already living in Spain on NLV means established networks and English-speaking services.</li>
