        <span class="msv__alert-icon">ℹ️</span>
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> Some Americans maintain both US supplemental insurance (for trips back to the US) and Spanish private insurance (for daily coverage in Spain). This is allowed and recommended if you plan to visit the US regularly. The consulate only requires proof of Spanish coverage, not exclusive coverage.</p>
